# Encore gateway configuration (server side only). Copy to `.env`, which git ignores, or export these in the
# gateway's own shell. Never commit a key, and never put one in a VITE_* variable: Vite inlines those into the app.
# Nothing loads this file automatically in this build.

# GATEWAY_PORT=8787

# gemini module (#117, #218). It stays off unless BOTH GEMINI_ENABLED and GEMINI_API_KEY are set, and this build has
# no live provider, so it answers 503 PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE / MODULE_DISABLED either way. GOOGLE_API_KEY is not read.
GEMINI_ENABLED=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite
# GEMINI_PROVIDER_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
# GEMINI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=45000
